<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <title>About FileVora — FileVora</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Learn about FileVora, an all-in-one collection of simple online tools for images, PDFs, text, calculations and developer tasks."
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tool-unified.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/filevora-header-tools.css">

  <style>
    .about-content {
      margin-top: 32px;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      margin: 32px 0 10px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 23px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .about-content p {
      margin: 0 0 15px;
    }

    .about-content a {
      color: #009a73;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .about-values {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }

    .about-value {
      padding: 22px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d7dce4;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    .about-value-number {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #009a73;
      background: #ecfdf8;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      border-radius: 11px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .about-value strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .about-value span {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .about-note {
      margin: 25px 0;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      color: #1e293b;
      background: #ecfdf8;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .about-values {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <%- include("partials/tool-header") %>

  <main class="info-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">FILEVORA</div>

        <h1>About FileVora</h1>

        <p class="info-lead">
          Simple online tools built to remove friction from everyday file and
          productivity tasks.
        </p>

        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Everything You Need in One Place</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora brings useful image, PDF, text, calculator, developer,
            security and audio tools together in one clean website.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our aim is to make common digital tasks easier without requiring
            complicated software, lengthy registration steps or unnecessary
            setup.
          </p>

          <div class="about-values">
            <div class="about-value">
              <div class="about-value-number">01</div>
              <strong>Easy to Use</strong>
              <span>
                Clear controls and straightforward steps designed for everyday
                users.
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-value">
              <div class="about-value-number">02</div>
              <strong>Fast Workflow</strong>
              <span>
                Get from input to result quickly with minimal unnecessary
                actions.
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-value">
              <div class="about-value-number">03</div>
              <strong>Growing Library</strong>
              <span>
                New tools and improvements can be added while keeping the
                experience familiar.
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2>Browser-Based Tools</h2>

          <p>
            Many FileVora tools are designed to process files and information
            directly inside your browser whenever the selected feature supports
            it.
          </p>

          <p>
            Browser-based processing helps provide a faster and more private
            workflow because locally processed files are not intentionally
            uploaded to FileVora’s servers.
          </p>

          <p>
            Tool behaviour and compatibility may vary depending on your
            browser, device, file format and available system resources.
          </p>

          <h2>What You Can Do with FileVora</h2>

          <p>FileVora includes tools that can help you:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Compress, resize, crop, rotate and convert images</li>
            <li>Merge, split, convert, protect and edit PDF files</li>
            <li>Count, clean, sort and transform text</li>
            <li>Perform calculations and useful conversions</li>
            <li>Format and convert developer data</li>
            <li>Generate passwords, hashes, QR codes and UUIDs</li>
            <li>Work with speech and audio features supported by your browser</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Our Approach</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora focuses on practical tools, understandable interfaces and
            consistent design. We want users to know what a tool does and how
            to use it without dealing with unnecessary clutter.
          </p>

          <div class="about-note">
            FileVora is continuously improving. Tool availability, browser
            compatibility and individual features may change as the website
            develops.
          </div>

          <h2>Privacy and Security</h2>

          <p>
            We encourage users to understand how online tools handle their
            files and to keep backup copies of important originals.
          </p>

          <p>
            Learn more by reading our
            <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and
            <a href="/security">Security page</a>.
          </p>

          <h2>Feedback and Support</h2>

          <p>
            Feedback helps us identify issues and understand which tools may be
            useful in the future.
          </p>

          <p>
            To report a problem, suggest a tool or ask a question, visit our
            <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> or email
            <a
              href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com&su=FileVora%20Feedback"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              filevora5@gmail.com
            </a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a class="hero-button" href="/#tools">Explore tools →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark">F</span>
          <span class="brand-name">File<span>Vora</span></span>
        </a>

        <p>Fast, simple online tools for everyday file tasks.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Company</h3>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Resources</h3>
        <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        <a href="/#tools">Tools</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Legal</h3>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Contact</h3>

        <a
          href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Email
        </a>

        <a href="/contact">Facebook</a>
        <a href="/contact">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container footer-bottom">
      <span>
        © <span data-current-year></span> FileVora. All rights reserved.
      </span>

      <span>All in One Tool.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document
      .querySelectorAll("[data-current-year]")
      .forEach(function (element) {
        element.textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
      });
  </script>

  <script src="/js/filevora-tools.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/filevora-header-tools.js"></script>

</body>
</html>